    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Journey \u2013 Help Shape the Future</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors Dawn started as a passion project, built using free resources and a drive to create an exciting zombie survival experience. Now, with player support, this could be the start of something bigger - expanding the game, growing a team, and bringing new talent into game development. Your feedback and engagement will help shape the future!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Undead Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your team, defend your camp, and fight for survival in this intense zombie shooter. The undead are relentless. Will you and your squad make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Command your survivors</strong>: Tina, Mona, Bob, Joe, Aisa, and Kumiko. Give orders, make tough decisions, and keep your team alive.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Scavenge for supplies</strong> and fortify your camp against the growing horde.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Take down zombies together</strong>. Slash with an axe, snipe with a crossbow, or blast through with a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is not just about firepower. It is about leadership. Can you outlast the apocalypse? <strong>Download now and prove you have what it takes!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Undead Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your team, defend your camp, and fight for survival in this intense zombie shooter. The undead are relentless. Will you and your squad make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Command your survivors</strong>: Tina, Mona, Bob, Joe, Aisa, and Kumiko. Give orders, make tough decisions, and keep your team alive.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Scavenge for supplies</strong> and fortify your camp against the growing horde.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Take down zombies together</strong>. Slash with an axe, snipe with a crossbow, or blast through with a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is not just about firepower. It is about leadership. Can you outlast the apocalypse? <strong>Download now and prove you have what it takes!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A tactical zombie survival shooter where you lead a squad, scavenge for supplies, and fight to outlast the undead.",
